flowchart TB
  User[User selects project and workspace] --> Shell[One native WPF shell]
  Shell --> Views[Workspace views / tabs / bookmarks]
  Views --> UI[Left groups / optional filters / center / optional companion]
  UI --> Registry[Module and typed action catalog]
  Registry --> Local[Shared local business data]
  Registry --> Gate[Permission and lifecycle gate]
  Gate --> Schedule[On-demand scheduler / shared cache / cancellation]
  Schedule --> Git[Local Git and GitHub adapter]
  Schedule --> Agent[Codex and Claude event adapters]
  Schedule --> Inventory[Runtime / environment / extension adapters]
  Schedule --> Cloud[Cloud usage / Grafana summaries]
  Schedule --> Device[Optional CPU / RAM / battery / usage]
  Schedule --> Knowledge[AtlasNote and Mongoku read-only bridges]
  Local --> Files[workspace.json / media]
  Views --> State[shell-workspaces.json]
  Gate --> Vault[Secret references to OS or external vault]
  Registry --> Launch[Explicit external app or browser launch]
  Launch --> Tools[VS Code / Mosaic / GitHub Desktop / Terminal / PowerToys]
  Files --> Export[Scoped review JSON or separate full backup]
  State --> Export
  Schedule --> Evidence[Source / scope / observed time / unknown or stale status]
  Evidence --> UI
